    {
      "text": "During Spectral Soul’s tribulation stretch, the Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance immortal zombie asks why Chu Rong is not back yet. Fairy Jiang Yu arrives with a terrible expression and reports that Chu Rong is dead and that the operation to take back Modest Thatched Hut failed.",
